{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ECC","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"传道书","commonName":"传道书","title":"传道书","order":21,"numberOfChapters":12,"sha256":"3f5b39eb02d7a1d6766cabadd5a21eb777a96ecc4aafa2082814665aaa8ba329","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":12,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/12.json","totalNumberOfVerses":221},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我看见日光之下有一件可悲的事，重重地压在人身上："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["上帝赐给人财富、产业和尊荣，叫他拥有所渴望的一切，却使他无法享用，倒让别人享用。这是虚空，是极大的悲哀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["人若有一百个儿子，并且长寿，但心中却从未因福乐而满足，死后又不得安葬，我看这样的人还不如流产的胎儿。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["这胎儿在虚空中来，在黑暗中去，名字隐没在黑暗中，"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["没有见过天日，一无所知，然而这胎儿比那人更享安息。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["就算那人活了千年，又活千年，却不能享受福乐，又如何呢？世人最终岂不都同归一处吗？"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["人人为口腹劳碌，却永不满足。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["那么，智者比愚人有什么优势呢？贫穷人即使懂得如何处世，又有什么益处呢？"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["满足于眼前所有的，胜过心中贪想的。这也是虚空，如同捕风。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["一切存在的事物都已命名，人的本质也被识透；人无法与比他更强的较量。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["其实话越多，越虚空，这对人又有什么益处？"]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":["人生短暂虚空，如影飞逝，有谁知道什么对人有益？谁能告诉人死后日光之下会发生什么事？"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ECC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":12}